                "title": "[Remote] Senior Salesforce Developer",
                "description": "<p>Note: The job is a remote job and is open to candidates in USA. Zachary Piper Solutions is seeking a Senior Salesforce Developer to support a federal healthcare program. This position is 100% remote and involves designing, developing, and maintaining custom Salesforce solutions for a large-scale federal platform.</p><br><p>Responsibilities</p><ul><li>Develop custom solutions using Apex, LWC, Aura, and JavaScript</li><li>Build and enhance applications within Service Cloud and Experience Cloud</li><li>Participate in design, development, testing, and deployment activities</li><li>Collaborate with Product Owners, Architects, and Agile teams</li><li>Conduct code reviews and mentor junior developers</li><li>Troubleshoot application, integration, and production issues</li><li>Support integrations, data migrations, and CI/CD processes</li><li>Maintain technical documentation and development standards</li></ul><br><p>Skills</p><ul><li>8+ years of Salesforce development experience with Apex and LWC and 3+ years leading Salesforce implementations</li><li>Salesforce Platform Developer I (PD I) and Platform Developer II (PD II) certifications required</li><li>Strong experience with Apex, Lightning Web Components (LWC), and Aura</li><li>Proficiency with JavaScript and Salesforce development tools</li><li>Experience developing custom Lightning components using LWC and Aura</li><li>Experience with Salesforce Lightning Design System (SLDS) and strong knowledge of SOQL and SOSL</li><li>Bachelors' degree required</li></ul><br><p>Benefits</p><ul><li>Full Benefits Package: PTO</li><li>Paid Holidays</li><li>Medical</li><li>Dental</li><li>Vision</li><li>401K</li><li>Tuition Reimbursement</li></ul><br><p>Company Overview</p><li>Zachary Piper Solutions is an IT company providing government contracting solutions in support of the nation’s Intelligence Community. It was founded in 2011, and is headquartered in Mclean, Virginia, USA, with a workforce of 201-500 employees. Its website is http://zacharypiper.com/.</li><br>",
